# JMeter output files (regenerated each run)
*.jtl
*.log
*-output/

# ...except the golden inputs. `*.jtl` above is right for run output — every scenario writes
# one and none of it belongs in git — but these two are FIXTURES: committed, fixed, and the
# reason the golden artifacts can be constants at all. Generated once with a seeded RNG and a
# fixed start timestamp, then frozen. Regenerating them is a deliberate act that rewrites every
# baseline in goldens/expected/.
!goldens/*.jtl
